                         Program Version 6.1.1  -  RELEASE   -

Fragments of an ORCA 6.1 output for water, cut down to the blocks EasyQM reads:
two optimisation cycles, frequencies with one imaginary mode, IR and Raman tables,
thermochemistry. The block formats are copied from real ORCA 6.1.1 output.

